  "notes": "Tipco Foods Public Company Limited (SET: TIPCO) \u2014 Thai diversified agribusiness, founded 1976. Core business is processed pineapple (canned/concentrate) and Tipco-brand fruit juices for Thai retail; also herbal supplements / plant-based protein expansion. Reports THB-millions Thai GAAP. Lists in THB on the Stock Exchange of Thailand. FY ends Dec 31. Smaller-cap (~THB 2bn revenue base) \u2014 earnings highly variable on pineapple supply (Thai harvest yields), shipping container availability, and juice consumer demand. FY24 swung to net loss on pineapple shortages + container availability; modest leverage profile.",
